WEBVTT

00:00:58.579 --> 00:01:01.496
whichever way we'd react
would be understood as just that,

00:01:01.537 --> 00:01:02.829
a reaction,

00:01:02.871 --> 00:01:05.121
not a deliberate decision.

00:01:05.163 --> 00:01:10.038
It would be an instinctual panicked move
with no forethought or malice.

00:01:10.204 --> 00:01:13.704
But if a programmer were to instruct
the car to make the same move,

00:01:13.746 --> 00:01:16.663
given conditions it may
sense in the future,

00:01:16.704 --> 00:01:20.996
well, that looks more
like premeditated homicide.

00:01:21.371 --> 00:01:22.579
Now, to be fair,

00:01:22.621 --> 00:01:25.163
self-driving cars are predicted
to dramatically reduce

00:01:25.204 --> 00:01:26.746
traffic accidents and fatalities

00:01:26.788 --> 00:01:30.496
by removing human error
from the driving equation.